graph TD
    %% COGNITIVE WRAPPER (The Persona Layer)
    subgraph Persona [Surgical Agent Persona: CLAUDE.md / SYSTEM.md]
        direction TB
        
        %% The Cognitive Filters
        Directives{Cognitive Filters}
        Directives --- Filter1[Think Before Coding]
        Directives --- Filter2[Simplicity First]
        Directives --- Filter3[Surgical Changes]
        Directives --- Filter4[Goal-Driven Execution]
        
        %% The Logic Circuit
        User((User)) -->|Request| Agent[Agent Reasoning Core]
        Agent -->|1. Triage| Router[Surgical Router: router.py]
        Router -.->|Reference| Graph[Route Graph: graph.json]
        Router -.->|Reference| Config[Tier Profiles: config.py]
        Graph -->|Return Route| Router
        Config -->|Return Profile| Router
        Router -->|Assign TierID| Agent
        
        Agent -->|2. Action| MCP[MCP Server: mcp_server.py]
        MCP -->|Invoke| Executor[Brain Executor: executor.py]
        
        Executor -->|L1| L1[L1 Surgical Read]
        Executor -->|L2| L2[L2 Functional Trace]
        Executor -->|L3| L3[L3 Analytical Crunch]
        Executor -->|L4| L4[L4 Orchestrated Synthesis]
        Executor -->|L5| L5[L5 Adversarial Critique]
        
        %% Infrastructure Loops
        L1 -->|Fetch| Nodes[Brain Nodes / Wiki]
        Nodes -->|Return Data| L1
        
        L2 -->|Trace| Deps[Dependency Map]
        Deps -->|Return Map| L2
        
        L3 -->|Crunch| Stack[Analytics Stack: Polars/DuckDB]
        Stack -->|Return Report| L3
        
        L4 -->|Spawn| Swarm[ruflo Swarm / DeepAgents]
        Swarm -->|Synthesize| L4
        
        L5 -->|Baseline| L4
        L5 -->|Probe| Review[Adversarial Review]
        Review -->|Return Critique| L5
        
        L1 & L2 & L3 & L4 & L5 -->|Pass Output| Executor
        
        %% Guardrail Phase
        Executor -->|3. Validate| Sovereign[Sovereign Validator: sovereign.py]
        Sovereign -.->|Check| State[Sovereign State: sovereign_state.md]
        State -->|Return Rules| Sovereign
        
        Sovereign -->|FAIL: Non-Sovereign| Agent
        Sovereign -->|PASS: Sovereign| Semantic[Surgical Semantic Layer]
        
        Semantic -->|Result| FinalResult((Final Result))
    end
    
    FinalResult --> User
    
    %% Linking Persona to Filters
    Agent -.->|Governed By| Directives
    Executor -.->|Governed By| Directives
    Sovereign -.->|Governed By| Directives
    
    %% Styling
    style Persona fill:#f5f5f5,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px,stroke-dasharray: 5 5
    style Agent fill:#f9f,stroke:#333,stroke-width:4px
    style Sovereign fill:#ff9,stroke:#f00,stroke-width:2px
    style Executor fill:#bbf,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
    style State fill:#fff,stroke:#f00,stroke-dasharray: 5 5
    style Directives fill:#fff,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
